# Dash local instance state — secrets (master-key) and PGlite data live here.
.dash/

# Dash instance state — the SpecStore roots under DASH_ROOT, written at runtime
# as connections, dashboards and reports are created. Local working data (and
# whichever vendor API you happened to test against), never source.
